## Project Title
Implement Client Script and UI Policy for Incident Management in ServiceNow

## Objective
The objective of this project is to improve the Incident Management process in ServiceNow by implementing Client Scripts and UI Policies.

## Requirements
1. Create and configure an Incident form.
2. Implement Client Scripts to perform client-side actions.
3. Implement UI Policies to control field visibility, mandatory status, and read-only behavior.
4. Automatically validate and update fields based on user input.
5. Improve the user experience while creating and updating incidents.
6. Ensure that the required fields are properly validated.

## Expected Outcome
The Incident form should dynamically respond to user actions. Client Scripts and UI Policies should work correctly and make the Incident Management process easier and more efficient.
